 341:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *
 342:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** * Summary:
 343:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *  Clears flags that control the operating mode of the clock. This function
 344:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *  only changes flags from 1 to 0; flags that are already 0 will remain
 345:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *  unchanged. To set flags, use the SetModeRegister function. The clock must be
 346:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *  disabled before changing the mode.
 347:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *
 348:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** * Parameters:
