 354:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *   - CYCLK_DUTY  Enable 50% duty cycle output. When enabled, the output clock
 355:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_2.c **** *                 is asserted for approximately half of its period. When
